2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (QCD\040and\040Collider\040Physics)
/Author (Richard\040Keith\040Ellis\054\040W\056\040J\056\040Stirling\054\040Bryan\040R\056\040Webber)
/Subject (One\040of\040the\040triumphs\040of\040modern\040particle\040physics\040has\040been\040the\040extent\040to\040which\040Quantum\040Chromodynamics\040\050QCD\051\040has\040successfully\040accounted\040for\040the\040strong\040interaction\040processes\040observed\040at\040high\055energy\040particle\040colliders\054\040for\040example\040the\040production\040of\040heavy\040quarks\040and\040jets\040of\040particles\054\040and\040the\040short\055distance\040parton\040structure\040of\040the\040proton\056\040This\040book\040gives\040a\040detailed\040overview\040of\040collider\040physics\040with\040special\040emphasis\040on\040the\040study\040of\040QCD\056\040After\040a\040general\040description\040of\040the\040QCD\040Lagrangian\054\040and\040the\040properties\040of\040asymptotic\040freedom\040and\040colour\040confinement\040which\040derive\040from\040it\054\040the\040most\040important\040applications\040at\040high\055energy\040colliders\040are\040described\040in\040detail\056\040These\040include\040the\040production\040of\040jets\054\040heavy\040quarks\054\040electroweak\040gauge\040bosons\040and\040Higgs\040bosons\056\040The\040various\040methods\040of\040measuring\040the\040strong\040coupling\040constant\040are\040summarised\056\040Many\040of\040the\040theoretical\040results\040are\040calculated\040from\040first\040principles\054\040and\040the\040book\040will\040be\040both\040a\040textbook\040and\040a\040valuable\040source\040of\040reference\040material\040for\040all\040particle\040physicists\056)
/Keywords (01\040Dec\0402003\054\040Higgs\040boson\054\040Quantum\040chromodynamics\054\040Technicolor\054\040Gauge\040boson\054\040Parton\054\040Fermilab\054\040Durham\040University\054\040University\040of\040Cambridge)
>>
endobj
